      "writtenOn": "2021-01-28T05:44:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Chun-Hung and Yong, the page-pool patches are under review both upstream as well as as android12-5.10 now. You can see the series here: https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/1550555/2 We have verified that the performance of the ACK DMA-BUF system heap is on-par with that of the ION system heap. I will send out the numbers as part of the GKI newsletter once they are merged. Please note that the DMA-BUF system heap is also a vendor module for GKI 2.0 so MTK is free to create their own version of system heap with Soc/device-specific optimizations.",
